C03: a typing order that names a place and no text asks what to write (UI1645)

«escribe en el diálogo el de ChadGBT» says where to type and not what. A typing order («escribe/tipea/type/write en/in <diálogo|chat|campo|buscador|box|field…>») with no quoted or trailing text now decides an explicit clarification of input.text.type with the text field missing: zero operations and a question asking what text to write, without opening or typing anything.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


